151
00:11:17,275 --> 00:11:18,571
-Yeah.

152
00:11:18,571 --> 00:11:21,336
-Do you remember
what happened after?

153
00:11:21,336 --> 00:11:23,632
-Yeah, you -- you tipped it in.

154
00:11:23,632 --> 00:11:26,693
-Oh, yeah.
That was awesome.

155
00:11:29,203 --> 00:11:33,660
-Okay, we have time
for just one more question.

156
00:11:33,660 --> 00:11:35,868
Josh.

157
00:11:35,868 --> 00:11:38,262
- Yes. Uh...

158
00:11:40,603 --> 00:11:43,136
Hey, man, I love the podcast.

159
00:11:43,136 --> 00:11:48,430
Uh, is it true that you took
a $113 million pay cut
just to re-sign with the Knicks?

160
00:11:48,430 --> 00:11:52,966
-Uh, yeah, that's pretty true.
- Wow.

161
00:11:52,966 --> 00:11:58,670
