164
00:12:14,225 --> 00:12:17,026
-Because it was funny?

165
00:12:18,268 --> 00:12:21,428
Uh, that -- that question
was a layup, bro.

166
00:12:21,428 --> 00:12:25,044
-Yeah, well, the last time
you hit a layup, you did this.

167
00:12:25,044 --> 00:12:26,701
-Fox throws it away!

168
00:12:26,701 --> 00:12:29,326
Josh Hart, ahead of the pack,
lays it up.

169
00:12:29,326 --> 00:12:31,837
Oh! Oh, he missed the layup!

170
00:12:31,837 --> 00:12:37,129
- Hey, bro,
AI be looking so real
these days, bro!

171
00:12:37,129 --> 00:12:38,632
It's crazy!

172
00:12:38,632 --> 00:12:41,647
-All right, well, guys,
can you come up here, please?

173
00:12:48,155 --> 00:12:51,533
We have a great show
for you tonight.
KATSEYE is here.

174
00:12:51,533 --> 00:12:53,758
Stick around.
We'll be right back.

175
00:13:19,885 --> 00:13:23,400
Man, those Pizza Hut sandwiches
really hit the spot, huh?

176
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:26,010
-Really, yeah.
-Sure did.
But, wait. Uh-oh!

177
00:13:26,010 --> 00:13:30,493
