187
00:14:01,789 --> 00:14:06,296
Anyway, back to work.
What's the status on, uh,
Thompson Park?

188
00:14:06,296 --> 00:14:10,106
-Yeah, we submitted an
application for a federal grant
about a month ago.

189
00:14:10,106 --> 00:14:12,157
-I think NPS is just backed up.

190
00:14:12,157 --> 00:14:15,171
The new regulations are just
too much for them to handle.

191
00:14:15,171 --> 00:14:16,896
-But, wait, guys.

192
00:14:16,896 --> 00:14:21,290
It turns out it wasn't
