193
00:14:21,290 --> 00:14:22,977
-What's this, now?

194
00:14:22,977 --> 00:14:27,567
-The referees are saying
there's still
one second left on the clock.

195
00:14:27,567 --> 00:14:32,444
They inbound the ball to Darius.
He shoots and...

196
00:14:34,638 --> 00:14:36,482
-Ohhh! Missed it again!

197
00:14:36,482 --> 00:14:39,959
Sorry, Darius. Looks like the
game is really over this time.

198
00:14:39,959 --> 00:14:45,457
-Yeah. It looks...
It's because the clock ran out.

199
00:14:45,457 --> 00:14:47,227
-Yep.

200
00:14:47,227 --> 00:14:51,798
So, um, is there any way
we can get this NPS thing
speeding along or...?

201
00:14:51,798 --> 00:14:54,650
