the ball back for one last shot.

209
00:15:18,167 --> 00:15:20,842
He shoots and...

210
00:15:21,423 --> 00:15:26,145
-Missed again!
And looks like you're all
out of wrappers, so...

211
00:15:26,145 --> 00:15:28,399
- Am I, bitch?

212
00:15:32,054 --> 00:15:33,983
Darius shoots.
-Oh.

213
00:15:33,983 --> 00:15:35,837
