222
00:15:56,061 --> 00:16:00,815
Can you get that through
your little pea brain
in your big-ass head

223
00:16:00,815 --> 00:16:04,814
that you suck at basketball?

224
00:16:04,814 --> 00:16:09,388
You can't get the ball
in the basket.
Do you get that?

225
00:16:09,388 --> 00:16:12,890
-But there's still one second --
-No, Darius!

226
00:16:12,890 --> 00:16:16,852
There's not one second left,
man.
Stop it, okay?

227
00:16:16,852 --> 00:16:19,170
You're bad at basketball.

